      "seed": 1529494425,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1885088962,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SCIM 2.0 push          IdP creates, updates and deactivates members and group memberships. Authoritative. Preferred for SaaS and VPC.\nDirectory sync (pull)  Scheduled read of LDAP/AD or Graph groups. Distribution lists become org units. Preferred on-prem.\nJust-in-time           First successful login provisions the member from verified claims. Requires a domain allowlist and a default org unit.\nInvite only            An admin invites an address; the first matching login claims the invitation. Default when no directory is connected.\nBulk import            CSV or DL export for pilots. Rows are staged, previewed, then committed as invitations.",
      "originalText": "SCIM 2.0 push          IdP creates, updates and deactivates members and group memberships. Authoritative. Preferred for SaaS and VPC.\nDirectory sync (pull)  Scheduled read of LDAP/AD or Graph groups. Distribution lists become org units. Preferred on-prem.\nJust-in-time           First successful login provisions the member from verified claims. Requires a domain allowlist and a default org unit.\nInvite only            An admin invites an address; the first matching login claims the invitation. Default when no directory is connected.\nBulk import            CSV or DL export for pilots. Rows are staged, previewed, then committed as invitations.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "autoResize": true
    },
