      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why the current console breaks — and what removes the class of bug",
      "originalText": "Why the current console breaks — and what removes the class of bug",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "text_2s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 52,
      "y": 939,
      "width": 1436,
      "height": 95,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1800050903,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 921297446,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Today the browser decides the auth mode from build-time VITE_OIDC_* variables, saves a session before onboarding has\nsucceeded, keeps it in sessionStorage, and then loads each screen through separate queries that can each fail with 403.\nAny one of those failing paints \"unable to login\" or \"something went wrong\" with no reason. The fix is structural:\nGET /v1/auth/config decides the mode, POST /v1/auth/session completes onboarding before a session is persisted, and\nGET /v1/session/bootstrap returns identity, permissions and navigation together so a rendered shell is always consistent.",
      "originalText": "Today the browser decides the auth mode from build-time VITE_OIDC_* variables, saves a session before onboarding has\nsucceeded, keeps it in sessionStorage, and then loads each screen through separate queries that can each fail with 403.\nAny one of those failing paints \"unable to login\" or \"something went wrong\" with no reason. The fix is structural:\nGET /v1/auth/config decides the mode, POST /v1/auth/session completes onboarding before a session is persisted, and\nGET /v1/session/bootstrap returns identity, permissions and navigation together so a rendered shell is always consistent.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
